WEBVTT

1
00:04:02.191 --> 00:04:07.436
I bow to all the seekers of truth.

2
00:04:11.041 --> 00:04:13.541
At the very outset

3
00:04:13.541 --> 00:04:16.041
we have to know

4
00:04:16.041 --> 00:04:20.775
