00:18:28.817 --> 00:18:33.037
then you should go to
anyone who talks about God.

260
00:18:33.071 --> 00:18:36.307
That’s first thing: have
they got godliness?

261
00:18:36.336 --> 00:18:38.567
Because William Blake has said,

262
00:18:38.567 --> 00:18:44.567
"There will be a special category of
people who will be born on this Earth."

263
00:18:44.567 --> 00:18:47.067
He calls them, “Men of God.”

264
00:18:47.067 --> 00:18:52.282
They will know God, and
they’ll make others godly.

265
00:18:52.322 --> 00:18:54.822
Now with Sahaja Yoga

266
00:18:54.822 --> 00:18:56.902
you get so many powers.

267
00:18:56.902 --> 00:19:02.852
The first and foremost is that you
yourself get completely physically cured.

268
00:19:02.851 --> 00:19:05.351
So many diseases are
cured by Sahaja Yoga.

269
00:19:05.351 --> 00:19:07.523
But it’s not a guarantee.

270
00:19:07.523 --> 00:19:11.231
If you get your realisation and if
you settle down in Sahaja Yoga,

271
00:19:11.261 --> 00:19:14.581
you don’t have to get to any diseases.

272
00:19:14.581 --> 00:19:17.081
It’s possible: we have worked it out,

273
00:19:17.081 --> 00:19:19.581
it has worked even in Australia,

274
00:19:19.581 --> 00:19:22.081
it has worked in India.
There are two doctors

275
00:19:22.081 --> 00:19:27.791
who have got M.D. in Sahaja
Yoga in Delhi University.

276
00:19:27.818 --> 00:19:30.318
There are seven doctors in England,

277
00:19:30.318 --> 00:19:32.818
who are experimenting, means

278
00:19:32.818 --> 00:19:35.142
they are documenting how many
people have been cured.

279
00:19:35.122 --> 00:19:37.302
We have such a lot of documentation

280
00:19:37.324 --> 00:19:39.192
that we don’t know how
to even transport it.

281
00:19:39.212 --> 00:19:46.122
And there are forty doctors in Russia
who are following Sahaja Yoga.

282
00:19:46.138 --> 00:19:48.862
I must say, unfortunately
Australia is one country

283
00:19:48.862 --> 00:19:51.362
where they never understood us.

284
00:19:51.362 --> 00:19:56.763
I’ve been coming here
from the year 1978.

285
00:19:56.763 --> 00:20:01.368
Unfortunately at that time all
these gurus were here prevalent,

286
00:20:01.368 --> 00:20:05.643
and nobody would accept us because
we are not charging any money.

287
00:20:05.659 --> 00:20:09.030
And it was impossible
to tell them about it.

288
00:20:09.030 --> 00:20:14.129
They would just walk out as soon as
I said we don’t take any money.

289
00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:18.460
It was really very
difficult to communicate.

290
00:20:18.492 --> 00:20:23.330
And as a result we have very few
Sahaja yogis, specially in Canberra,

291
00:20:23.356 --> 00:20:25.856
and the report is that they come

292
00:20:25.856 --> 00:20:28.235
but they just disappear.

293
00:20:28.235 --> 00:20:30.635
But if they have commitment
of money then they stick on,

294
00:20:30.635 --> 00:20:33.685
because you paid for it, you see.

295
00:20:33.718 --> 00:20:36.218
Like you go to see some funny film

296
00:20:36.218 --> 00:20:38.445
or some funny drama
and you don’t like it,

297
00:20:38.445 --> 00:20:40.945
but still you stick on
because you paid for it.

298
00:20:42.935 --> 00:20:47.936
Is a human psychology. But I say,
how much can you pay for it?

299
00:20:47.951 --> 00:20:52.278
How much can you pay for
it? It’s so invaluable.

300
00:20:52.275 --> 00:20:54.775
You see, you cannot
measure it in money.

301
00:20:54.775 --> 00:20:56.828
God doesn’t understand money,

302
00:20:56.840 --> 00:21:01.090
He doesn’t understand banks. This is
your headache, it’s not His headache.

303
00:21:01.123 --> 00:21:07.324
So, once we understand one
thing: it’s a pure thing,

304
00:21:07.334 --> 00:21:10.904
it’s so pure. Reality
cannot be purchased;

305
00:21:10.924 --> 00:21:13.924
you have to know it.

306
00:21:13.944 --> 00:21:16.874
So, now these centres are here,

307
00:21:16.904 --> 00:21:20.794
as you see: he must have told
you about them one by one.

308
00:21:20.831 --> 00:21:25.034
And when you come to this course they
will tell you all about it in details,

309
00:21:25.055 --> 00:21:27.415
and within, I’m sure, seven weeks

310
00:21:27.444 --> 00:21:30.195
you all will become great
masters of Sahaja Yoga.

311
00:21:30.242 --> 00:21:32.065
And you can cure people,

312
00:21:32.065 --> 00:21:35.251
you can raise their kundalini.

313
00:21:35.265 --> 00:21:38.231
Not only raise their kundalini, but

314
00:21:38.245 --> 00:21:41.401
you can

315
00:21:41.415 --> 00:21:46.367
understand this subtle
knowledge in no time.

316
00:21:46.390 --> 00:21:49.866
It really increases your capacity

317
00:21:49.900 --> 00:21:52.400
of your intelligence
so much that we have

318
00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:55.710
had children who came
to us as dullards

319
00:21:55.730 --> 00:21:58.230
and now they are scoring so well,

320
00:21:58.230 --> 00:22:00.480
they have records.

321
00:22:00.480 --> 00:22:03.420
Not in India, even in Australia
they are doing so well.

322
00:22:03.450 --> 00:22:07.760
Now in England which is, which
has got a disease of unemployment,

323
00:22:07.781 --> 00:22:11.440
in Sahaja Yoga it’s hard to find
even one person who is unemployed;

324
00:22:11.440 --> 00:22:15.312
because we don’t think that taking
dole is a very respectable thing.

325
00:22:15.312 --> 00:22:18.460
So suddenly they get their
jobs and they work it out.

326
00:22:18.482 --> 00:22:23.702
It’s something that happens: a person
becomes so dynamic, so relaxed.

327
00:22:23.736 --> 00:22:25.656
Now these days there
are so many diseases

328
00:22:25.701 --> 00:22:27.346
about which I need
not tell you;

329
00:22:27.352 --> 00:22:29.182
but specially the
tension that you have,

330
00:22:29.182 --> 00:22:32.132
because I was told most of
them are bureaucrats here.

331
00:22:32.150 --> 00:22:34.762
My husband has been a
bureaucrat all his life,

332
00:22:34.762 --> 00:22:38.242
so I know what it is.  I know
the bureaucrats very well.

333
00:22:40.612 --> 00:22:42.122
This tension comes to us

334
00:22:42.160 --> 00:22:44.702
because we work too much on the
right side, as you see there,

335
00:22:44.710 --> 00:22:47.492
this yellow line.

336
00:22:47.510 --> 00:22:50.802
And that develops onto another
horrible thing called as ego:

337
00:22:50.831 --> 00:22:53.631
that we feel we are doing
it. There’s nothing wrong,

338
00:22:53.681 --> 00:22:56.181
it’s nothing wrong, because
ignorance gives you

339
00:22:56.181 --> 00:23:00.173
that idea that “I am doing this work.”
There’s nothing wrong in feeling that way.

340
00:23:00.225 --> 00:23:02.443
But what happens that
when kundalini rises,

341
00:23:02.453 --> 00:23:04.953
she pushes that down

342
00:23:04.983 --> 00:23:06.863
and makes, I call it as a 'chimney,'

343
00:23:06.863 --> 00:23:09.163
because that’s what they
understand in English language,

344
00:23:09.163 --> 00:23:12.153
that it makes like an opening here.

345
00:23:12.153 --> 00:23:15.801
And this opening takes away
all the heat of the work

346
00:23:15.806 --> 00:23:18.306
and the idea that “I
am doing this work.”

347
00:23:18.306 --> 00:23:20.806
You just don’t feel you are doing it;

348
00:23:20.806 --> 00:23:22.676
it’s so relaxed.

349
00:23:22.676 --> 00:23:24.826
All these problems that you have,

350
00:23:24.832 --> 00:23:27.332
as the bureaucrats specially,
I will explain to you

351
00:23:27.332 --> 00:23:28.882
what problems they have.

352
00:23:28.889 --> 00:23:32.822
In this short time whatever is
possible I’ll try to give you.

353
00:23:32.826 --> 00:23:35.488
Now, we work on the right
side: they’re bureaucrats

354
00:23:35.488 --> 00:23:37.988
it's because they’re planning,

355
00:23:37.988 --> 00:23:40.806
because they’re thinking too much.

356
00:23:40.806 --> 00:23:45.878
They are futuristic people, planning,
planning, planning like mad.

357
00:23:45.904 --> 00:23:49.444
Not only, but their nature
becomes such a planning,

358
00:23:51.504 --> 00:23:53.604
that if they are going on the road,

359
00:23:53.604 --> 00:23:57.330
immediately they’ll say, “Oh, they
should have put this signboard here.

360
00:23:57.330 --> 00:23:59.830
They should have done that there. They
should have put this tree there.”

361
00:23:59.830 --> 00:24:03.883
I mean, you are not doing that job at all,
you see, you are nothing to do with it.

362
00:24:03.883 --> 00:24:07.695
But they’ll go on thinking for others
also what they should have done,

363
00:24:07.715 --> 00:24:09.980
what it is should be
done, that should be done.

364
00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:15.213
So all the time thinking, thinking
makes them mad, with this...

365
00:24:17.828 --> 00:24:20.074
with this right side
developing too much,

366
00:24:20.086 --> 00:24:21.416
they become work alcoholics,

367
00:24:21.437 --> 00:24:23.647
and they are very unkind in
the family also because,

368
00:24:23.654 --> 00:24:26.154
you see, they are so
irritable sometimes.

369
00:24:26.154 --> 00:24:28.654
And sometimes they try to
push back the temper,

370
00:24:28.654 --> 00:24:30.932
and that’s how they
become even worse.

371
00:24:30.932 --> 00:24:36.412
Because this, this centre, this is
a very special centre within us:

372
00:24:36.418 --> 00:24:38.918
we call it as Swadishthan.

373
00:24:38.918 --> 00:24:42.308
This centre outside, in the...

374
00:24:42.328 --> 00:24:47.388
we can say in the physical way
or in the medical terminology,

375
00:24:48.624 --> 00:24:50.904
acts through our aortic plexus.

376
00:24:50.904 --> 00:24:53.514
I studied medicine forty years back

377
00:24:53.514 --> 00:24:55.684
so but now, they might
have changed the name,

378
00:24:55.684 --> 00:24:58.004
but we used to know as aortic plexus.

379
00:24:58.004 --> 00:25:01.919
This aortic plexus looks after this...

380
00:25:01.924 --> 00:25:05.894
viscera as you see there, whole
thing, all that, all the viscera.

381
00:25:05.894 --> 00:25:10.344
And here is one, first one, is the liver.

382
00:25:10.362 --> 00:25:14.984
Now liver is the one that’s
very important in our body,

383
00:25:15.844 --> 00:25:20.918
which is responsible for taking out
all the poison of the body as heat,

384
00:25:20.947 --> 00:25:24.278
and deliver it into the bloodstream.

385
00:25:24.303 --> 00:25:29.603
But when this centre is doing
something else much more important,

386
00:25:29.607 --> 00:25:32.133
then it is neglected

387
00:25:32.141 --> 00:25:34.641
Now, what is this
important thing we do,

388
00:25:34.641 --> 00:25:39.201
that this centre also has a responsibility

389
00:25:39.233 --> 00:25:44.921
to supply energy to the brain
or supply even some cells,

390
00:25:44.941 --> 00:25:50.491
fat cells, for the displacement
of the used-out cells

391
00:25:50.532 --> 00:25:53.372
and nourishing them with new cells.

392
00:25:53.402 --> 00:25:55.902
So when we think too
much all the time,

393
00:25:55.902 --> 00:25:58.482
this poor centre gets very busy,

394
00:25:58.512 --> 00:26:01.942
and it has no time for your liver.

395
00:26:01.973 --> 00:26:04.473
So the liver gets into trouble.

396
00:26:04.473 --> 00:26:09.692
Now when the liver gets heated
up, the heat passes upward.

397
00:26:09.708 --> 00:26:14.853
When it passes upward, it touches the
centre that we call it as the right heart.

398
00:26:15.933 --> 00:26:19.033
This centre when is heated up,

399
00:26:19.051 --> 00:26:25.063
then the lungs start getting
coagulated and you develop asthma.

400
00:26:25.063 --> 00:26:27.483
Of course, it has also due to

401
00:26:27.523 --> 00:26:33.483
the effect of the left side which
I’ll tell you later on which,

402
00:26:33.490 --> 00:26:36.671
which triggers it, which
triggers this asthma.

403
00:26:36.700 --> 00:26:39.200
Now this asthma

404
00:26:39.200 --> 00:26:44.031
once settled in cannot be cured
by any means but by Sahaja Yoga.

405
00:26:44.029 --> 00:26:47.969
We have cured, I mean, not I
would say I have cured, but

406
00:26:47.979 --> 00:26:51.389
Sahaja Yoga has cured
through kundalini awakening,

407
00:26:51.399 --> 00:26:54.579
asthma of a gentleman
who was an architect.

408
00:26:54.579 --> 00:26:57.929
Mostly architects also
are of the same style:

409
00:26:57.959 --> 00:27:01.549
they get asthma, very common,

410
00:27:01.549 --> 00:27:04.759
and there’s another disease they
get which I’ll tell you later on,

411
00:27:04.787 --> 00:27:11.132
and that is also a result of
this kind of over-thinking.

412
00:27:11.162 --> 00:27:14.842
Now when you neglect

413
00:27:14.852 --> 00:27:18.382
your liver, also the
heat passes downward.

414
00:27:18.382 --> 00:27:22.458
When it passes downward
it catches your kidneys.

415
00:27:22.458 --> 00:27:25.532
And the kidneys get coagulated
and they cannot function,

416
00:27:25.543 --> 00:27:28.822
so you get kidney trouble. And the
doctors don’t want to tell you the truth

417
00:27:28.832 --> 00:27:33.232
but I would like to tell you,
that dialysis can never cure you.

418
00:27:33.238 --> 00:27:38.618
And it’s such an expensive thing, you
become bankrupt and die, that’s all.

419
00:27:38.632 --> 00:27:42.502
So for that, what is the
treatment?  Is in Sahaja Yoga.

420
00:27:42.502 --> 00:27:46.882
We have been able to see that people
get cured of their kidney trouble

421
00:27:46.882 --> 00:27:50.232
with a very simple
method of Sahaja Yoga.

422
00:27:50.232 --> 00:27:53.694
Because we are dealing with
the fundamental thing:

423
00:27:53.727 --> 00:27:55.872
like if there’s a tree which is sick

424
00:27:55.869 --> 00:27:58.019
if you want to apply some
medicine on the leaves

425
00:27:58.019 --> 00:28:00.349
it doesn’t work out; you
have to go to the roots

426
00:28:00.359 --> 00:28:03.509
So we go to the roots very
easily through your kundalini,

427
00:28:03.509 --> 00:28:05.339
and it works out.

428
00:28:05.358 --> 00:28:07.009
Now there’s another
disease they develop,

429
00:28:07.027 --> 00:28:09.279
because the heat can
pass to the left side.

430
00:28:09.307 --> 00:28:11.639
Now supposing
somebody who is young

431
00:28:11.639 --> 00:28:16.587
and he’s very ambitious and is sort
of a sportsman, we can call him,

432
00:28:16.587 --> 00:28:19.087
playing tennis or
football or such a game,

433
00:28:19.087 --> 00:28:21.078
and drinking too much.

434
00:28:21.078 --> 00:28:22.988
All this creates heat very much,

435
00:28:22.988 --> 00:28:25.978
and may get a massive heart
attack at a very young age,

436
00:28:26.007 --> 00:28:28.377
and it’s absolutely vital.

437
00:28:28.377 --> 00:28:30.547
Also such people get heart attacks

438
00:28:30.569 --> 00:28:35.957
of the massive type later on, who have
got this problem of too much working.

439
00:28:35.957 --> 00:28:38.457
There’s another kind of a
heart attack we call angina,

440
00:28:38.457 --> 00:28:41.879
due to lethargic heart which is,
which comes from the left side.

441
00:28:43.107 --> 00:28:46.459
They are two things, one is
the left and another is right

442
00:28:46.459 --> 00:28:50.959
and when we confuse them we do not
know what to treat what person.

443
00:28:50.959 --> 00:28:55.829
But in Sahaja Yoga you can easily find
out a person is right-sided or left-sided,

444
00:28:55.844 --> 00:28:59.104
or is it psychosomatic:
means combination of both.

445
00:28:59.141 --> 00:29:01.164
It’s very simple to find out.

446
00:29:01.198 --> 00:29:06.908
Now then the another horrible disease
that comes to a person who is

447
00:29:06.922 --> 00:29:09.538
sitting on the table and
planning, is diabetes.

448
00:29:09.558 --> 00:29:11.338
It’s very common.

449
00:29:11.338 --> 00:29:16.608
If a woman also is diabetic, her
child can get it as an inheritance.

450
00:29:16.624 --> 00:29:19.338
Now this diabetes comes to you as a result

451
00:29:19.338 --> 00:29:26.908
because you think too much and you
neglect, the pancreas is neglected.

452
00:29:26.908 --> 00:29:33.527
This pancreas is responsible for looking
after your problems of diabetes.

453
00:29:33.527 --> 00:29:40.477
And when it is done then what you get is
a collapse of this pancreas in a way,

454
00:29:40.477 --> 00:29:43.437
and you start getting
this diabetes in you.

455
00:29:43.457 --> 00:29:45.957
Here also the left-side
triggering is done

456
00:29:45.957 --> 00:29:50.847
when you get diabetes. But diabetes
also is quite curable in Sahaja Yoga.

457
00:29:50.847 --> 00:29:53.347
If you practice it properly every day,

458
00:29:53.347 --> 00:29:55.797
morning, evening, five
minutes in the morning

459
00:29:55.797 --> 00:29:58.057
and ten minutes in the
evening, it works out.

460
00:29:58.057 --> 00:30:01.643
Now the other disease that you
get is much more dangerous is,

461
00:30:01.652 --> 00:30:03.492
is the blood cancer.

462
00:30:03.492 --> 00:30:08.372
It comes from the spleen which
is again neglected by this centre

463
00:30:08.379 --> 00:30:11.032
and you lead a very, very hectic life.

464
00:30:11.032 --> 00:30:16.931
Actually all the bureaucrats are on,

465
00:30:16.957 --> 00:30:19.801
on very highly strung notes

466
00:30:19.807 --> 00:30:21.921
and they are very hectic also.

467
00:30:21.921 --> 00:30:25.269
Early in the morning they will, they
cannot get up, they are so tired.

468
00:30:25.276 --> 00:30:28.869
So they get up just about
ten minutes before the work,

469
00:30:28.865 --> 00:30:30.955
somehow or other
push their clothes in

470
00:30:30.973 --> 00:30:34.155
and just rush out; the wife
runs with the breakfast too!

471
00:30:35.889 --> 00:30:38.599
And they get into the car
and then they see a jam,

472
00:30:38.599 --> 00:30:41.099
and they get so upset.
Now they are so time-bound

473
00:30:41.099 --> 00:30:44.353
that’s again problem.
They are so time-bound.

474
00:30:44.358 --> 00:30:48.883
And in these days when
there is so much of

475
00:30:48.891 --> 00:30:53.162
jam and all that on the street and they
get so frustrated, they are so hectic.

476
00:30:53.170 --> 00:30:57.752
All this hectic-ness leads us
into a very funny situation,

477
00:30:57.758 --> 00:31:01.768
because this spleen

478
00:31:01.781 --> 00:31:06.658
is responsible for creating RBCs,
that is red blood corpuscles,

479
00:31:06.662 --> 00:31:09.541
whenever you are in emergency.

480
00:31:09.562 --> 00:31:14.051
When you are in emergency,
then this starts working more.

481
00:31:14.051 --> 00:31:17.711
For example, if you have taken your food
and if you start running, you’ll get a pain,

482
00:31:17.721 --> 00:31:19.361
terrible pain on this side.

483
00:31:19.361 --> 00:31:22.276
That’s because your spleen
has gone into action,

484
00:31:22.296 --> 00:31:25.186
it's producing more
red blood corpuscles.

485
00:31:25.196 --> 00:31:27.696
So this hectic life
that you have today,

486
00:31:27.696 --> 00:31:33.576
you make this poor spleen a

487
00:31:33.592 --> 00:31:37.528
crazy one because she doesn’t
know what this man is up to.

488
00:31:37.559 --> 00:31:40.698
Suddenly he becomes so
much excited and he

489
00:31:40.726 --> 00:31:43.226
gets into emergency, then
again he gets into emergency,

490
00:31:43.226 --> 00:31:47.469
so this spleen gets
absolutely into problem.

491
00:31:47.492 --> 00:31:49.992
And when again some
triggering takes place,

492
00:31:49.992 --> 00:31:52.858
then you develop this blood cancer.

493
00:31:52.862 --> 00:31:55.362
But the another, as I told you,

494
00:31:55.362 --> 00:32:03.573
the kidney, and a person who is like this
is suffering always from constipation.

495
00:32:03.573 --> 00:32:14.641
Because it also, heat goes down and it
makes this lower end into a kind of a

496
00:32:14.669 --> 00:32:17.429
very dry, dry thing

497
00:32:17.429 --> 00:32:21.886
and that’s how people suffer from
terrible constipation sometime.

498
00:32:21.902 --> 00:32:28.069
This is a little bit that I’ve told, that
a bureaucrat is capable of suffering.

499
00:32:29.502 --> 00:32:32.552
Also is possible, paralysis;

500
00:32:32.592 --> 00:32:35.992
paralysis he gets on the right side.

501
00:32:36.000 --> 00:32:38.500
Also he might get a
frozen arm, right arm

502
00:32:38.500 --> 00:32:42.860
frozen, all sorts of things:
migraines because of bad liver,

503
00:32:42.899 --> 00:32:45.399
and cirrhosis of the liver,

504
00:32:45.399 --> 00:32:48.780
cancer of... the other day we met one
fellow who had cancer of the liver.

505
00:32:48.779 --> 00:32:51.019
And the doctor said, “You are a gone case.”

506
00:32:51.019 --> 00:32:52.829
I found out he’s a very
big boss somewhere.

507
00:32:52.851 --> 00:32:57.506
I said, “Now you’d better resign for
a while, and then I’ll work it out.”

508
00:32:57.526 --> 00:33:01.386
So all these things
are to be understood

509
00:33:01.406 --> 00:33:03.336
in a proper way

510
00:33:03.356 --> 00:33:06.875
and we have to treat
ourselves with respect.

511
00:33:06.896 --> 00:33:10.745
We have to govern our body properly.

512
00:33:10.754 --> 00:33:13.254
In Sahaja Yoga you’ll
get all the knowledge

513
00:33:13.254 --> 00:33:16.851
that is necessary for you to
know about your wellbeing,

514
00:33:16.851 --> 00:33:18.831
first of all.

515
00:33:18.831 --> 00:33:23.928
And then you will also know
how to keep yourself all right.

516
00:33:23.948 --> 00:33:27.398
Now this is something that
I have told you already,

517
00:33:27.413 --> 00:33:31.548
but the left-side triggering takes
place when you go to wrong places

518
00:33:31.548 --> 00:33:33.728
like this and to wrong gurus:

519
00:33:33.737 --> 00:33:35.908
they, I think, mesmerise you
or I don’t know what they do.

520
00:33:35.910 --> 00:33:37.858
Their styles I don’t understand,

521
00:33:37.875 --> 00:33:40.578
because they do not tell you the
modus operandi as to what they do,

522
00:33:40.578 --> 00:33:44.264
while you’ll know the complete
modus operandi of Sahaja Yoga.

523
00:33:44.294 --> 00:33:46.714
You yourself become masters of this.

524
00:33:46.714 --> 00:33:49.214
If you use a little

525
00:33:49.214 --> 00:33:51.714
assiduity, if you little bit work it out,

526
00:33:51.714 --> 00:33:57.055
I’m sure you yourself will be surprised
how you have become your masters.

527
00:33:57.055 --> 00:33:59.094
But this is only the
physical side of it.

528
00:33:59.091 --> 00:34:01.591
Even emotionally those
people who have suffered,

529
00:34:01.591 --> 00:34:05.161
like epilepsy and also you
can say mental disorders

530
00:34:05.161 --> 00:34:07.051
and all that, have
been very much helped,

531
00:34:07.051 --> 00:34:09.400
because that’s the left
side will work out.

532
00:34:09.421 --> 00:34:11.831
Now the psychosomatic
diseases are like...

533
00:34:11.831 --> 00:34:14.351
We call them, even
diabetes, as psychosomatic

534
00:34:14.371 --> 00:34:18.831
because there’s a effect of the left
on them; or myelitis and all this,

535
00:34:18.831 --> 00:34:22.707
what you call it, the disability of the
muscles to work out, all these things,

536
00:34:22.707 --> 00:34:25.891
and recently another disease
called as the yuppies’ disease.

537
00:34:25.891 --> 00:34:29.370
I had, I had

538
00:34:29.391 --> 00:34:33.631
told them beforehand, five years
before this disease came in.

539
00:34:33.645 --> 00:34:35.755
I had also told them about the AIDS.

540
00:34:35.755 --> 00:34:40.925
But as I was not taking any money,
Americans were not interested.

541
00:34:40.947 --> 00:34:44.667
Because Americans are so
proud of their money;

542
00:34:44.667 --> 00:34:48.109
they think, “How can we
not purchase this woman?”

543
00:34:48.107 --> 00:34:51.377
Moreover when I went to America, you’ll
be surprised, they asked Me a question,

544
00:34:51.377 --> 00:34:53.157
“How many Rolls-Royces You have?”

545
00:34:53.157 --> 00:34:55.317
I said, “I have none.”

546
00:34:55.317 --> 00:34:58.347
They said, “We are not interested
in You. You have no business.”

547
00:34:58.347 --> 00:35:00.847
I said, “I have no business.
There’s no business about it.”

548
00:35:00.847 --> 00:35:04.427
But this is difficult to make
them understand, Americans,

549
00:35:04.436 --> 00:35:06.907
that God is not a business.

550
00:35:06.914 --> 00:35:09.214
They want to make business
out of everything,

551
00:35:09.214 --> 00:35:12.764
and now see the situation there
of the business that they did:

552
00:35:12.770 --> 00:35:15.760
what is their situation is not very good.

553
00:35:15.780 --> 00:35:18.780
So whatever, even the
business you are doing,

554
00:35:18.800 --> 00:35:22.610
even the economic side of it, has to be understood

555
00:35:22.610 --> 00:35:24.950
that we have to have a balance.

556
00:35:24.960 --> 00:35:30.030
If we don't have a balance, we
cannot achieve anything in life.

557
00:35:30.030 --> 00:35:34.140
And this imbalancing has taken us to
this ecological problem, this problem.

558
00:35:34.170 --> 00:35:37.620
Actually most of this problem,
all these universal problems,

559
00:35:37.638 --> 00:35:41.480
if you see, all these global
problems, come from human beings.

560
00:35:41.504 --> 00:35:44.834
You know My husband has been
working with this U.N.

561
00:35:44.864 --> 00:35:48.524
and he agrees with Me entirely:
it all comes from human beings.

562
00:35:48.524 --> 00:35:51.024
And if this transformation
can take place,

563
00:35:51.024 --> 00:35:54.624
we don’t even have to have
U.N., you just become united

564
00:35:54.624 --> 00:35:58.332
within, not outside, but
you just become united.

565
00:35:58.332 --> 00:36:01.524
And this is what you achieve
is a collective consciousness,

566
00:36:01.524 --> 00:36:04.024
a new awareness within you.

567
00:36:04.024 --> 00:36:07.402
You start feeling the cool breeze
in your hands, the vibrations,

568
00:36:07.425 --> 00:36:09.882
very soothing,

569
00:36:09.882 --> 00:36:12.961
and you can feel the
centres of all the persons.

570
00:36:12.972 --> 00:36:15.921
And you can also feel your centres

571
00:36:15.932 --> 00:36:23.707
and you know how to correct
them, yours and others.

572
00:36:24.997 --> 00:36:28.708
This is a new awareness that comes
to you as collective consciousness.

573
00:36:28.732 --> 00:36:32.748
Thank God, Jung has already talked
about it, that if you have to evolve,

574
00:36:32.769 --> 00:36:35.209
you will evolve into a new awareness

575
00:36:35.233 --> 00:36:38.483
as collective consciousness, and

576
00:36:38.502 --> 00:36:42.203
in Sanskrit language it is
called as “samuhik chetana.”

577
00:36:42.215 --> 00:36:51.619
The first state where you reach
is out of this Agnya Chakra:

578
00:36:51.639 --> 00:36:54.709
when you cross over
to the limbic area,

579
00:36:54.739 --> 00:36:57.239
you become thoughtlessly aware.

580
00:36:57.239 --> 00:37:01.469
You are aware, but thoughtless. So
you become a very peaceful person.

581
00:37:01.503 --> 00:37:04.749
People who have got peace awards,

582
00:37:04.773 --> 00:37:08.729
I haven’t seen them, seen
such hot-tempered people.

583
00:37:08.729 --> 00:37:11.229
I don’t know, from where did
they get this peace award?

584
00:37:11.229 --> 00:37:13.729
Extremely hot-tempered: you can’t

585
00:37:13.729 --> 00:37:15.867
go near them without a
barge-pole, you know!

586
00:37:15.877 --> 00:37:18.169
Any time they are willing
to have a hit at you.

587
00:37:18.179 --> 00:37:20.799
And they have got peace awards,

588
00:37:20.809 --> 00:37:22.679
Nobel awards, this,
that. I mean, I

589
00:37:22.679 --> 00:37:25.389
don’t know from what angle they
got, get all these things,

590
00:37:25.409 --> 00:37:27.469
what is the judgment point is.

591
00:37:27.469 --> 00:37:30.719
So one has to know that
the peace has to be within,

592
00:37:30.749 --> 00:37:34.518
and this peace is established. You
become a witness of the whole drama.

593
00:37:34.545 --> 00:37:37.788
You start seeing the
whole thing as a drama.

594
00:37:37.805 --> 00:37:41.798
You are away from the problems and
that’s how you can solve the problems,

595
00:37:41.798 --> 00:37:46.021
and once you become an expert you can
help others to solve the problems.

596
00:37:46.039 --> 00:37:48.692
It’s something awaiting us.

597
00:37:48.692 --> 00:37:51.192
We all have to rise to that level, and

598
00:37:51.192 --> 00:37:57.022
to get to that state where
we can really have that

599
00:37:57.042 --> 00:37:59.522
special status which is meant for us.

600
00:37:59.552 --> 00:38:01.482
Is your right to have it.

601
00:38:01.482 --> 00:38:06.172
As a result, you’ll be
surprised, you’ll be so free

602
00:38:06.202 --> 00:38:08.572
and so capable to enjoy the freedom.

603
00:38:08.572 --> 00:38:12.222
People don’t even enjoy their freedom
because they are not capable.

604
00:38:12.222 --> 00:38:14.722
Like, you see, our democracy
has become demonocracy,

605
00:38:14.722 --> 00:38:17.222
because we don’t know
how to enjoy our freedom,

606
00:38:17.222 --> 00:38:19.595
we don’t know how to
balance our freedom.

607
00:38:19.595 --> 00:38:23.502
But after that, what happens,
automatically you become so free

608
00:38:23.502 --> 00:38:26.992
I mean, you get rid of all your habits.

609
00:38:27.012 --> 00:38:30.422
In England I, first time
when I started My work,

610
00:38:30.432 --> 00:38:35.116
I got seven hippies,
all drenched in drugs.

611
00:38:35.141 --> 00:38:39.716
But they were brought like
dead pieces before Me.

612
00:38:39.740 --> 00:38:44.056
And overnight they
gave up their drugs.

613
00:38:44.076 --> 00:38:46.576
I said, “Look at that!

614
00:38:46.576 --> 00:38:48.395
How is it possible?”

615
00:38:48.395 --> 00:38:50.895
They had not established
their Sahaja Yoga so far,

616
00:38:50.895 --> 00:38:54.385
but they gave up their drugs, all
right. An example is like this,

617
00:38:54.412 --> 00:38:57.844
that supposing you are
holding onto a snake

618
00:38:57.872 --> 00:39:01.054
and you have no capacity to give it up,

619
00:39:01.062 --> 00:39:04.484
and moreover you are obstinate.

620
00:39:04.494 --> 00:39:07.597
There’s all darkness, you can’t see;
somebody tells you it’s a snake.

621
00:39:07.597 --> 00:39:10.937
You won’t give it up till it bites you,

622
00:39:10.937 --> 00:39:14.347
till you are dead. So

623
00:39:14.357 --> 00:39:17.827
if there’s a little light in you,
immediately you, yourself throw it away.

624
00:39:17.827 --> 00:39:20.797
I don’t have to tell you anything;
you do it yourself everything.

625
00:39:20.797 --> 00:39:23.767
You become your own
masters. You guide yourself

626
00:39:23.767 --> 00:39:28.035
because you are great, as I’ve told you,
but you have to touch your divinity.

627
00:39:28.035 --> 00:39:31.497
And it should not be, like
as we have in the schools,

628
00:39:31.507 --> 00:39:34.327
a mathematical proposition

629
00:39:34.327 --> 00:39:38.343
in smaller classes they used to
say, a house was to be built,

630
00:39:38.343 --> 00:39:41.457
'A’ came for one day, ran away,

631
00:39:41.473 --> 00:39:45.534
'B’ came for two days, ran away, and
third came for half a day and ran away.

632
00:39:45.534 --> 00:39:48.783
When will the work be over? Never,

633
00:39:48.794 --> 00:39:51.914
is the answer! Because if you
have such run-away people,

634
00:39:51.914 --> 00:39:54.824
how can you have the house being built?

635
00:39:54.824 --> 00:39:57.324
I mean, it’s not possible, mathematically

636
00:39:57.334 --> 00:40:00.674
it is not possible, but it might be
imaginary, you might think like that.

637
00:40:00.681 --> 00:40:04.163
So you have to pay some
attention to your realisation,

638
00:40:04.163 --> 00:40:07.621
you have to pay to yourself,
and to your ascending.

639
00:40:07.621 --> 00:40:10.121
I don’t know how many
you are here today,

640
00:40:10.121 --> 00:40:12.376
and I feel sorry that
we didn’t have a hall;

641
00:40:12.387 --> 00:40:15.679
because last time we had a big hall
and it was practically empty,

642
00:40:15.679 --> 00:40:18.529
so we thought this time we
should have a smaller hall.

643
00:40:19.899 --> 00:40:22.208
It was a miscalculation
completely on our behalf,

644
00:40:22.208 --> 00:40:23.959
I must say, and I am sorry for this,

645
00:40:23.977 --> 00:40:26.129
that you all have to stand like this.

646
00:40:26.129 --> 00:40:28.629
But I’m sure whatever
may be the situation

647
00:40:28.629 --> 00:40:30.779
we all will get realisation today.

648
00:40:30.793 --> 00:40:33.108
You should have full
confidence in yourself

649
00:40:33.128 --> 00:40:36.068
that we are all going to
get our Self-realisation.

650
00:40:36.089 --> 00:40:39.199
Of course, I would like you
to ask Me some questions

651
00:40:39.229 --> 00:40:41.269
for a very...   because we started little late

652
00:40:41.269 --> 00:40:43.559
because of this music and all that,

653
00:40:43.559 --> 00:40:48.917
but I would like you to ask Me
some questions for a while,

654
00:40:48.922 --> 00:40:52.430
and then we’ll have this
process of Self-realisation

655
00:40:52.445 --> 00:40:55.640
As far as the questions are
concerned I would say that,

656
00:40:55.650 --> 00:40:58.700
that I am not here to take
anything away from you,

657
00:40:58.730 --> 00:41:02.240
but I’m here just to give
you the key of your own being,

658
00:41:02.261 --> 00:41:04.761
to know yourself. So

659
00:41:04.761 --> 00:41:08.091
ask relative questions,
not aggressive ones,

660
00:41:08.091 --> 00:41:10.591
because I’m very good at
answering, I must tell you,

661
00:41:10.591 --> 00:41:12.941
because I’ve been now
answering questions

662
00:41:12.978 --> 00:41:15.861
for the last twenty
years all over the world.

663
00:41:15.881 --> 00:41:19.508
So I’m quite clever and I’ll
answer all your questions.

664
00:41:19.508 --> 00:41:22.288
But it’s a mental feat, again I’ll say it:

665
00:41:22.298 --> 00:41:24.928
that is no guarantee that
you’ll get your realisation,

666
00:41:24.928 --> 00:41:27.751
that is no guarantee. So
it’s just a mental feat.

667
00:41:27.751 --> 00:41:31.788
If you have any sensible question
please ask Me, because I don’t want

668
00:41:31.800 --> 00:41:35.468
at the time of realisation suddenly
your mind comes up and says,

669
00:41:35.468 --> 00:41:38.420
“Now, hey, you didn’t ask
this question to Mataji.”

670
00:41:38.458 --> 00:41:42.390
So please, whatever is possible, we’ll
take about fifteen minutes for that,

671
00:41:42.404 --> 00:41:44.904
and after that we’ll have a realisation

672
00:41:44.904 --> 00:41:47.854
which will take hardly ten to
fifteen minutes, that’s all.

673
00:41:47.854 --> 00:41:52.207
I hope you have all that patience. After
that I would like to meet all of you today.

674
00:41:52.212 --> 00:41:54.712
Those who get realisation
I would like to meet you,

675
00:41:54.712 --> 00:41:59.078
because I may not be back
here for one year at least.

676
00:41:59.098 --> 00:42:01.598
May God bless you.

677
00:42:24.204 --> 00:42:26.704
Questions?

678
00:42:31.768 --> 00:42:34.268
There’s one thing I would like to suggest,

679
00:42:34.268 --> 00:42:36.168
that those who are Sahaja
yogis can go and stand,

680
00:42:36.178 --> 00:42:38.678
and those who are not
can come and sit down.

681
00:42:38.678 --> 00:42:41.998
It’s better that the Sahaja
yogis can go and stand there.

682
00:42:42.028 --> 00:42:45.580
Those who are not Sahaja yogis
yet should come here, this side,

683
00:42:45.580 --> 00:42:48.518
and please be seated.

684
00:42:48.540 --> 00:42:51.040
Sahaja yogis can stand now.

685
00:43:08.480 --> 00:43:12.763
If the kundalini is awakened are you
then more sensitive to other people

686
00:43:12.763 --> 00:43:15.623
and their ailments and
the ailments of yourself

687
00:43:15.623 --> 00:43:17.583
Yes, of course, that’s what I said.

688
00:43:17.593 --> 00:43:20.903
Not only aware, but you know
each and everything about them:

689
00:43:20.915 --> 00:43:25.373
not outward things but their centres, you
know what’s wrong with their centres.

690
00:43:25.378 --> 00:43:28.353
So when you say that the
Pentecost got their realisation,

691
00:43:28.353 --> 00:43:31.973
when the Holy Ghost blessed them, they
started talking in some other language

692
00:43:31.973 --> 00:43:33.743
it’s not Latin or Hebrew,

693
00:43:33.755 --> 00:43:37.153
but they started talking in the
language of chakras or centres,

694
00:43:37.163 --> 00:43:39.663
as we also talk the same way.

695
00:43:47.453 --> 00:43:49.953
Traditionally in the literature of India

696
00:43:49.953 --> 00:43:53.983
when we look at the
information about kundalini,

697
00:43:53.993 --> 00:43:57.823
it appears to be a very
difficult and arduous process.

698
00:43:57.823 --> 00:43:59.203
It’s true.

699
00:43:59.203 --> 00:44:03.213
So what has occurred in
1970 or since then,

700
00:44:03.248 --> 00:44:05.403
that now makes it accessible to everybody?

701
00:44:05.403 --> 00:44:07.903
Yah!  You see, it’s true, it’s very difficult.

702
00:44:07.903 --> 00:44:10.403
If something very difficult
is done by someone,

703
00:44:10.403 --> 00:44:14.409
then there must be something
about it, isn’t it?

704
00:44:14.423 --> 00:44:16.359
It is very difficult.

705
00:44:16.369 --> 00:44:21.729
And once, a guru of
Shivaji was asked

706
00:44:21.758 --> 00:44:24.519
how much time does it take
for kundalini to rise.

707
00:44:24.553 --> 00:44:28.000
He used the word, Sanskrit word,
“tat kshan” ” means “that moment.”

708
00:44:28.000 --> 00:44:31.333
But there should be a
person who is able to give

709
00:44:31.333 --> 00:44:33.513
and the one who is able to receive it;

710
00:44:33.520 --> 00:44:37.736
and that’s all ready now, I
think, so it’s working out.

711
00:44:38.812 --> 00:44:43.296
You are capable of receiving, and I
think I am quite capable of giving!

712
00:44:52.832 --> 00:45:07.446
Inaudible question

713
00:45:16.725 --> 00:45:18.715
I didn't hear.

714
00:45:18.749 --> 00:45:20.485
She said she has experienced

715
00:45:20.515 --> 00:45:22.095
She’s just standing.
No, no, yes in front.

716
00:45:22.108 --> 00:45:22.945
This way?

717
00:45:22.965 --> 00:45:25.465
No, no, no.

718
00:45:25.465 --> 00:45:28.187
The light you can bring it down
a little bit at least, you see.

719
00:45:28.197 --> 00:45:29.677
I never used to use spectacles,

720
00:45:29.690 --> 00:45:32.190
but because of these lights
all the time on My eyes.

721
00:45:32.191 --> 00:45:33.091
Ha, now, better.

722
00:45:33.091 --> 00:45:36.331
She says she has experienced kundalini

723
00:45:36.343 --> 00:45:38.913
and she’s experienced
an increase in energy,

724
00:45:38.918 --> 00:45:41.483
but she doesn’t know
what to do with it.

725
00:45:41.498 --> 00:45:43.501
She was in Sahaja Yoga?

