I should say, or kind to themselves.

963
00:59:18.657 --> 00:59:21.417
But not otherwise.

964
00:59:21.417 --> 00:59:26.997
We, this awakening is taking place very
fast and it’s spreading very fast,

965
00:59:27.023 --> 00:59:32.679
and every candle that is enlightened
can enlighten another thousand candles.

966
00:59:32.679 --> 00:59:36.113
So it’s not so. We have to change
the world only in this way;

967
00:59:36.113 --> 00:59:38.613
there’s no other way out.
Through this transformation.

968
00:59:40.394 --> 00:59:46.492
Shri Mataji asks Vinay to ask a Sahaja
Yogi to request their realisation.

969
00:59:48.731 --> 00:59:51.231
Any other question, please?

970
00:59:52.701 --> 01:00:03.801
[Inaudible question]

971
01:00:03.841 --> 01:00:09.180
Could You tell us a little about the
traditions that this system is based on?

972
01:00:09.206 --> 01:00:11.706
All right.

973
01:00:11.706 --> 01:00:18.199
Now, the tradition is that we
had a group, we should say,

974
01:00:18.199 --> 01:00:22.279
we called them as Nath Panthis  in India

975
01:00:22.299 --> 01:00:25.269
who were working on the central path,

976
01:00:25.299 --> 01:00:28.219
which is called as Sushumna.

977
01:00:28.249 --> 01:00:36.459
But the tradition was that only one
guru could have only one disciple.

978
01:00:36.468 --> 01:00:39.514
That was the tradition
for ages together.

979
01:00:40.638 --> 01:00:43.174
And we had this Gorakhnath, and you

980
01:00:43.185 --> 01:00:45.445
must have heard about the Machhindranath, Gorakhnath, Adinath,

981
01:00:45.472 --> 01:00:49.395
all these people.

982
01:00:49.422 --> 01:00:52.332
But only in the twelfth century

983
01:00:52.352 --> 01:00:57.302
there was a great saint called Gyaneshwara,

984
01:00:57.335 --> 01:01:03.692
and he begged of his
brother who was his guru,

985
01:01:03.723 --> 01:01:09.832
that “please allow me at least to talk
about this in the local languages.”

986
01:01:09.852 --> 01:01:12.792
Now in all the great books
in Sanskrit language,

987
01:01:12.792 --> 01:01:15.902
like Yog Vasistha
and all these books

988
01:01:15.939 --> 01:01:17.229
even in the sixth century

989
01:01:17.249 --> 01:01:20.009
Adi Shankaracharya has
described about kundalini.

990
01:01:20.016 --> 01:01:24.143
Everywhere it is described,
but in Sanskrit language.

991
01:01:24.178 --> 01:01:27.233
Sanskrit language was only
read by very few people.

992
01:01:28.438 --> 01:01:33.858
At the time of Rama, His
father-in-law was Janaka:

993
01:01:33.889 --> 01:01:37.348
he was a great master of Sahaja Yoga,

994
01:01:37.380 --> 01:01:41.247
and he gave realisation to only
one person called Nachiketa.

995
01:01:41.247 --> 01:01:44.109
He’s mentioned there.

996
01:01:44.117 --> 01:01:50.977
Then it was all limited.

997
01:01:50.988 --> 01:01:55.675
But in the twelfth century Gyaneshwara

998
01:01:55.698 --> 01:01:58.198
described it

999
01:01:58.198 --> 01:02:02.129
in a treatise which he wrote about Gita,

1000
01:02:02.147 --> 01:02:05.197
Gyaneshwari, in the sixth chapter.

1001
01:02:05.217 --> 01:02:08.297
But the people whom we
call as dharma-markandas,

1002
01:02:08.327 --> 01:02:11.457
is the people who are in charge of
religion, couldn’t do anything about it.

1003
01:02:11.487 --> 01:02:15.587
So they said this is nishida,
means is not to be accepted,

1004
01:02:15.587 --> 01:02:18.952
it’s not to be read. So that
chapter were closed down.

1005
01:02:18.973 --> 01:02:22.482
In that he has written very clearly

1006
01:02:22.513 --> 01:02:25.013
that, “I have now said

1007
01:02:25.013 --> 01:02:27.513
as a great homage

1008
01:02:27.513 --> 01:02:30.503
to the spirit of the universe,

1009
01:02:30.503 --> 01:02:36.413
that now please give us the
blessings for the masses.”

1010
01:02:36.428 --> 01:02:39.330
And he’s described Sahaja Yoga very well:

1011
01:02:39.378 --> 01:02:42.910
what will happen when you get your blessings,

1012
01:02:42.921 --> 01:02:46.320
how the collective consciousness will
come and how people will evolve,

1013
01:02:46.320 --> 01:02:48.820
what will happen.

1014
01:02:48.820 --> 01:02:51.879
He did this on the twelfth century.

1015
01:02:51.910 --> 01:02:54.539
After that we had Kabira, we had Nanaka,

1016
01:02:54.539 --> 01:02:57.669
we had Ramadasa, we had Tukarama;

1017
01:02:57.669 --> 01:03:02.356
we had so many of saints
who have talked about it.

1018
01:03:02.366 --> 01:03:08.606
But still it could not go very further. Far!

1019
01:03:08.636 --> 01:03:14.236
Only two, three people used to get realisation.

1020
01:03:14.272 --> 01:03:17.516
Even “Buddha” itself means
“the realised soul.” Buddha,

1021
01:03:17.516 --> 01:03:19.826
Buddha, Buddha means from
bodha. “Bodha” means

1022
01:03:19.826 --> 01:03:24.206
“to know on your
central nervous system.”

1023
01:03:24.214 --> 01:03:28.906
So all of them said the same.
Even Christ has said it.

1024
01:03:28.929 --> 01:03:32.749
“You are to be born again.”
Clearly He has said it.

1025
01:03:32.792 --> 01:03:36.419
So we’ll have the certificate on
top: “We are born again.” Finished!

1026
01:03:36.459 --> 01:03:39.419
We don't go further with it.

1027
01:03:42.089 --> 01:03:46.189
We have to make enquiry:
what does this mean?

1028
01:03:49.307 --> 01:03:52.819
Because all these religions
were organised, you see.

1029
01:03:52.819 --> 01:03:56.529
You could not go out of this thing.

1030
01:03:56.559 --> 01:04:00.352
And those who tried to go were
thrown out of the religion.

1031
01:04:02.464 --> 01:04:05.724
Only in India the philosophy is
there, it’s not a religion as such.

1032
01:04:05.724 --> 01:04:08.224
I mean, you can say that the Sikhs,

1033
01:04:08.224 --> 01:04:10.724
the Jainies

1034
01:04:10.724 --> 01:04:13.224
and all of them are all in philosophy level;

1035
01:04:13.224 --> 01:04:17.485
it’s not organised at all. Nothing is organised.

1036
01:04:17.504 --> 01:04:19.925
The saints then came out of it

1037
01:04:19.925 --> 01:04:23.365
and they lashed all the society,
and they talked about the reality.

1038
01:04:23.365 --> 01:04:27.352
They have all talked about it in
their own vernacular languages.

1039
01:04:27.352 --> 01:04:29.852
Now, some of the songs they are singing was

1040
01:04:29.852 --> 01:04:32.585
written in the sixteenth century by Namadeva

1041
01:04:32.585 --> 01:04:35.865
I’ll ask them to sing this song.
It’s sung in every village,

1042
01:04:35.885 --> 01:04:39.945
where they are singing, “Oh Mother,
give us our realisation." Jogwa.

1043
01:04:41.465 --> 01:04:44.185
So we had this tradition in us.

1044
01:04:44.185 --> 01:04:46.965
But then these gurus
started coming up, because

1045
01:04:47.005 --> 01:04:49.095
they said we now have to have a guru.

1046
01:04:49.095 --> 01:04:50.745
Now, guru and a real guru, there

1047
01:04:50.745 --> 01:04:57.045
are descriptions already
given in vernacular languages.

1048
01:04:57.055 --> 01:05:00.804
Despite that, you see,
human beings are so great

1049
01:05:00.804 --> 01:05:04.645
that they can mess, make a
mess of everything, I tell you.

1050
01:05:04.684 --> 01:05:07.415
You give them anything beautiful,
they know how to make a mess.

1051
01:05:09.785 --> 01:05:12.285
And this is what they have done it.

1052
01:05:12.285 --> 01:05:15.179
Now let them get their realisation,

1053
01:05:15.215 --> 01:05:18.475
let them get perfected.

1054
01:05:18.495 --> 01:05:23.335
Let them get that subtle knowledge,

1055
01:05:23.335 --> 01:05:27.305
and then they can judge.

1056
01:05:27.345 --> 01:05:30.525
You become like a divine computer.

1057
01:05:30.545 --> 01:05:33.255
You can feel it on your
fingertips, the absolute truth.

1058
01:05:33.255 --> 01:05:37.706
You ask a question, “Was Christ
the son of God or not?”

1059
01:05:37.736 --> 01:05:40.236
Immediately you’ll start
feeling tremendous vibrations.

1060
01:05:40.236 --> 01:05:44.646
Even to take Christ’s name you will see.

1061
01:05:44.666 --> 01:05:48.666
The time has come for you
to prove all these things.

1062
01:05:48.676 --> 01:05:51.176
Otherwise everybody thinks they
are correct, like Saddam Hussein.

1063
01:05:51.176 --> 01:05:54.746
What’s wrong with him? He
thinks he was the chosen one,

1064
01:05:54.756 --> 01:05:56.856
by Mohammed Himself.

1065
01:05:56.876 --> 01:05:59.286
Then what can you do to such a person?

1066
01:05:59.286 --> 01:06:02.577
If you have such make-believes,
you cannot help it.

1067
01:06:02.586 --> 01:06:06.306
Hitler thought the same way.

1068
01:06:06.326 --> 01:06:08.826
But what is the criteria?

1069
01:06:10.326 --> 01:06:12.826
We live in a relative world.

1070
01:06:12.826 --> 01:06:14.846
We have to go to absolute.

1071
01:06:14.857 --> 01:06:16.996
If we accept this humbly,

1072
01:06:17.026 --> 01:06:19.956
then only we can have it. But if
you are satisfied with something

1073
01:06:19.956 --> 01:06:23.216
or your brain is washed
by some ideologies,

1074
01:06:23.246 --> 01:06:25.326
then I can’t help it.

1075
01:06:25.326 --> 01:06:27.826
But what good it has done to us?

1076
01:06:27.826 --> 01:06:30.326
Think it over.

1077
01:06:32.676 --> 01:06:34.416
While Hinduism, same thing,

1078
01:06:34.436 --> 01:06:39.826
where it is said that in
everybody it resides the spirit.

1079
01:06:39.836 --> 01:06:42.094
How can we have caste system?

1080
01:06:42.094 --> 01:06:45.401
This all came later on.

1081
01:06:45.434 --> 01:06:49.091
There’s a brahmin saint, a
great saint in India, Dasganu,

1082
01:06:49.091 --> 01:06:51.591
He says, “We have not known the Brahma.

1083
01:06:51.591 --> 01:06:56.121
We have not known this all-pervading
Power. How are we brahmins?”

1084
01:07:01.151 --> 01:07:03.651
There are so many instances to prove

1085
01:07:03.651 --> 01:07:09.142
that caste system is something
that is put on our head.

1086
01:07:11.188 --> 01:07:13.688
But it’s there,

1087
01:07:13.688 --> 01:07:16.038
and we have to fight it.

1088
01:07:16.038 --> 01:07:19.258
It’s the aptitude of a person.

1089
01:07:19.298 --> 01:07:23.104
It’s not inherent or it is not

1090
01:07:23.134 --> 01:07:24.554
prenatal;

1091
01:07:24.554 --> 01:07:27.054
it is just what type of thing you do.

1092
01:07:27.054 --> 01:07:30.334
I would say all Sahaja
yogis are the real brahmins,

1093
01:07:30.344 --> 01:07:33.744
because they know the Brahma.

1094
01:07:38.784 --> 01:07:41.934
You recommend meditation and chanting every day.

1095
01:07:41.941 --> 01:07:45.684
How long should one
maintain the chanting?

1096
01:07:45.693 --> 01:07:48.565
We have no chanting, madam, at all, no.

1097
01:07:48.583 --> 01:07:51.083
It spoils your throat.

1098
01:07:55.503 --> 01:07:58.833
Five minutes in the morning,
ten minutes in the evening:

1099
01:07:58.865 --> 01:08:01.365
is it too much of a time?

1100
01:08:02.885 --> 01:08:05.385
And chanting is another nonsense.

1101
01:08:07.565 --> 01:08:11.255
When you are not connected with
God, what are you chanting?

1102
01:08:13.191 --> 01:08:18.126
If your telephone is not working...
now see, we must be logical about it

1103
01:08:19.366 --> 01:08:20.596
what’s the use of telephoning?

1104
01:08:20.626 --> 01:08:23.626
Your telephone gets spoilt.

1105
01:08:23.646 --> 01:08:27.816
It’s so logical, I tell you.

1106
01:08:27.846 --> 01:08:31.465
Supposing now you have
the prime minister here

1107
01:08:31.496 --> 01:08:36.476
and you just go into his area
and start taking there his name,

1108
01:08:36.492 --> 01:08:40.086
they’ll all arrest you there.

1109
01:08:40.112 --> 01:08:42.066
You have to have connection.

1110
01:08:42.066 --> 01:08:48.358
But once you are in His Kingdom,
just remembering once is sufficient.

1111
01:08:48.385 --> 01:08:49.968
Even mantras:

1112
01:08:49.965 --> 01:08:52.388
they will just give you some
sort of a nonsensical mantra

1113
01:08:52.388 --> 01:08:55.088
like these T.M. people have
given you horrible mantras,

1114
01:08:55.088 --> 01:08:58.898
I must tell you this, horrible.

1115
01:08:58.928 --> 01:09:02.548
They are the worst, I think, as
far as money-making is concerned.

1116
01:09:02.553 --> 01:09:06.366
We had three people, four people.

1117
01:09:06.386 --> 01:09:10.986
One of them was the head
of their Flying Academy,

1118
01:09:10.991 --> 01:09:12.846
from Scotland.

1119
01:09:12.846 --> 01:09:15.346
His name is Peter Pierce, another his wife,

1120
01:09:15.346 --> 01:09:23.812
another his child, and fourth
one was the, his director.

1121
01:09:23.852 --> 01:09:27.937
They all came to Me with epilepsy.

1122
01:09:27.972 --> 01:09:29.827
Of course, now they are cured.

1123
01:09:29.853 --> 01:09:34.337
But poor things, they have all become
bankrupt and have gone to South Africa.

1124
01:09:34.337 --> 01:09:36.657
They are writing a book about it.

1125
01:09:36.657 --> 01:09:39.157
And they told Me about it,
and then many of them came.

1126
01:09:39.157 --> 01:09:41.947
Even we have some now in
Sydney and everywhere,

1127
01:09:41.955 --> 01:09:45.957
poor things suffering so much.

1128
01:09:45.963 --> 01:09:50.373
And they told Me that
three mantras were given.

1129
01:09:50.403 --> 01:09:51.923
One was “inga, pinga, tinga.”

1130
01:09:51.923 --> 01:09:54.793
Now any Indian here will know that
these are not Sanskrit words.

1131
01:09:54.793 --> 01:09:56.973
They’ll just start laughing at these things.

1132
01:09:56.973 --> 01:10:04.992
And they paid for each mantra three
hundred pounds, in those days.

1133
01:10:05.022 --> 01:10:07.402
Now “inga” means....

1134
01:10:07.402 --> 01:10:09.902
it’s a very colloquial village thing

1135
01:10:09.902 --> 01:10:14.251
because the guru who is there, he
doesn’t know any Sanskrit, nothing.

1136
01:10:14.261 --> 01:10:15.981
He was just a clerk;

1137
01:10:16.003 --> 01:10:20.683
I think he was a ticket collector.

1138
01:10:20.703 --> 01:10:23.633
Yah, he was a ticket collector in India.

1139
01:10:25.263 --> 01:10:28.603
But all the bureaucrats fell at his feet.

1140
01:10:28.633 --> 01:10:31.133
Do you know that? That’s the best part of it!

1141
01:10:31.133 --> 01:10:33.633
What is the bona fide of this man?

1142
01:10:34.665 --> 01:10:38.825
Now this fellow...   is the “inga” means

1143
01:10:38.825 --> 01:10:41.605
“scorpion bite”, is “inga”;

1144
01:10:41.635 --> 01:10:43.985
and “pinga” means when you

1145
01:10:43.985 --> 01:10:46.205
get possessed you go round
and round, it's “pinga”;

1146
01:10:46.217 --> 01:10:49.307
and “tinga” means this,

1147
01:10:50.457 --> 01:10:54.471
For that you pay three hundred pounds!

1148
01:10:56.311 --> 01:10:59.201
Then six thousand pounds were paid.

1149
01:10:59.201 --> 01:11:01.701
A barrister who had become mad,

1150
01:11:01.701 --> 01:11:04.561
her sister had become mad.
She was in lunatic asylum;

1151
01:11:04.561 --> 01:11:08.151
she was brought out, then now she is
cured. Both of them are all right.

1152
01:11:09.811 --> 01:11:12.971
Her name is Hester.

1153
01:11:13.001 --> 01:11:16.981
She told Me, “Six thousand pounds
they took from all of us.

1154
01:11:16.983 --> 01:11:21.291
We had to go to Switzerland in
very far-fetched horrible hotel,

1155
01:11:21.306 --> 01:11:25.866
and they put us there for this flying course.”

1156
01:11:25.901 --> 01:11:29.986
And they had to jump on some forms
and they all broke their bottoms,

1157
01:11:30.004 --> 01:11:31.634
to begin with.

1158
01:11:31.634 --> 01:11:36.364
But the food that was given to them,
for six days they had to drink water

1159
01:11:36.407 --> 01:11:39.714
which boiled the potatoes.

1160
01:11:39.744 --> 01:11:44.224
Then the seventh day they had to
take the rind of the potatoes.

1161
01:11:44.254 --> 01:11:47.194
And the eighth day the potatoes.

1162
01:11:47.234 --> 01:11:49.734
For six thousand pounds!

1163
01:11:51.694 --> 01:11:55.545
And this, I’m sure this guru must be
thinking how stupid these people are.

1164
01:11:55.545 --> 01:12:00.554
So he used to, he used to giggle all
the time. He could not help giggling.

1165
01:12:04.698 --> 01:12:06.896
And they are every time
marketing something new.

1166
01:12:06.896 --> 01:12:11.536
Now they are marketing here, what you
call, ayurveda. What is there to market?

1167
01:12:11.563 --> 01:12:14.345
Why do you need a guru for that?

1168
01:12:14.375 --> 01:12:17.845
And ayurveda cannot be
marketed in the West

1169
01:12:17.865 --> 01:12:21.905
in the real sense, because
you have to use fresh leaves.

1170
01:12:21.955 --> 01:12:24.461
You cannot.

1171
01:12:24.485 --> 01:12:27.855
One gentleman had a very bad
eczema. He was from Australia,

1172
01:12:27.874 --> 01:12:30.965
but then he came to England
and then he came to Russia.

1173
01:12:30.965 --> 01:12:32.315
I told him, “You have to come to India,

1174
01:12:32.315 --> 01:12:35.505
because I know one thing by
which it can be easily cured.

1175
01:12:35.505 --> 01:12:38.335
It’s a very simple leaf you have to use.”

1176
01:12:38.355 --> 01:12:40.855
And in three days he was all right.

1177
01:12:42.694 --> 01:12:45.545
So even if you have to practice

1178
01:12:45.565 --> 01:12:48.035
that, you don’t have to
have a guru for that.

1179
01:12:48.035 --> 01:12:51.376
Why do you? This is just
a marketing thing.

1180
01:12:55.645 --> 01:12:58.145
They’ll sell anything.

1181
01:12:58.145 --> 01:13:00.645
How can you sell anything?

1182
01:13:04.495 --> 01:13:05.755
Use your brains!

1183
01:13:05.755 --> 01:13:10.005
By God’s grace, you all have much
more brains than Indians have.

1184
01:13:10.016 --> 01:13:11.945
But we have much more
wisdom, I think,

1185
01:13:11.945 --> 01:13:14.515
because we have known
all this kind of thing.

1186
01:13:14.534 --> 01:13:17.034
And thank God, we don’t have
so much money to waste.

1187
01:13:19.174 --> 01:13:21.674
Our poverty is a blessing
to us, I think, in a way.

1188
01:13:23.674 --> 01:13:26.403
That’s why they have gone abroad.

1189
01:13:27.674 --> 01:13:30.054
They have formed groups,
they have formed this, that,

1190
01:13:30.054 --> 01:13:32.554
everywhere, and nobody would listen to Me.

1191
01:13:32.554 --> 01:13:36.814
In America they told Me, “You’d better go
back. Nobody is going to listen to You.”

1192
01:13:39.388 --> 01:13:42.448
Now let’s see how the
Australians are going to take it.

1193
01:13:56.788 --> 01:13:59.288
Thank God, I was born in a Christian religion,

1194
01:13:59.288 --> 01:14:01.788
because I can talk to
you about it very clearly.

1195
01:14:02.888 --> 01:14:07.988
My father joined Gandhiji. Immediately
he was thrown out of the church.

1196
01:14:09.797 --> 01:14:11.727
Because in India people, Christians,

1197
01:14:11.746 --> 01:14:15.907
mostly they are converted
from poor classes, you see.

1198
01:14:17.832 --> 01:14:20.332
So they think, they believe even now

1199
01:14:20.332 --> 01:14:22.832
that Christ was born in
England.

1200
01:14:24.012 --> 01:14:26.512
Can you beat that?

1201
01:14:35.552 --> 01:14:40.656
[Inaudible question]

1202
01:14:47.845 --> 01:14:52.725
No, you see, the meditation as I told
you is a little attention to yourself.

1203
01:14:52.755 --> 01:14:56.955
You are not to “do” meditation, but
you have to get into meditative mood.

1204
01:14:56.955 --> 01:15:01.912
As I told you, first you get into
the state of thoughtless awareness,

1205
01:15:01.928 --> 01:15:03.218
where you know everything

1206
01:15:03.218 --> 01:15:06.268
but there’s no thought. That
is, you are in the present.

1207
01:15:06.298 --> 01:15:08.798
You are neither in the
future nor in the past,

1208
01:15:08.798 --> 01:15:11.196
but you are the present
where there is no thought.

1209
01:15:11.196 --> 01:15:14.413
You watch everything,
you see everything;

1210
01:15:14.431 --> 01:15:18.533
but nothing you react. Just
there, you are seeing.

1211
01:15:18.538 --> 01:15:20.398
That’s a very great state,

1212
01:15:20.409 --> 01:15:24.178
because when you just see something...

1213
01:15:24.178 --> 01:15:26.678
now see, I look at these flowers.

1214
01:15:26.678 --> 01:15:29.178
Now if you are not a realised soul and
you look at these flowers, you think

1215
01:15:29.178 --> 01:15:31.678
from where they must
have got it now and

1216
01:15:31.678 --> 01:15:35.148
how much they must have paid,
all those things, what colours.

1217
01:15:35.150 --> 01:15:38.240
I don’t think like that; I just look at it.

1218
01:15:38.260 --> 01:15:40.760
And all the joy

1219
01:15:40.760 --> 01:15:43.260
that is put into it by the Creator

1220
01:15:43.280 --> 01:15:45.780
just starts flowing down

1221
01:15:45.810 --> 01:15:48.919
in the abstract way.

1222
01:15:48.930 --> 01:15:52.534
So that first state when you achieve,

1223
01:15:52.534 --> 01:15:55.930
in that state you start growing spiritually.

1224
01:15:55.954 --> 01:15:59.100
So achieve that state, you have
to pay attention to yourself.

1225
01:15:59.100 --> 01:16:02.551
Now if I say “Now you pay
attention to yourself,” you cannot.

1226
01:16:02.560 --> 01:16:05.981
All right. Now if I say the attention
is spread like then like this shawl,

1227
01:16:06.015 --> 01:16:08.802
and the kundalini is here: she
starts coming up like that.

1228
01:16:08.825 --> 01:16:11.325
So she puts your attention inside.

1229
01:16:11.325 --> 01:16:15.521
When she puts your attention inside
and she breaks this through,

1230
01:16:15.545 --> 01:16:20.141
then all this attention gets
enlightened and nourished by her.

1231
01:16:20.141 --> 01:16:22.415
This is to be seen within your life.

1232
01:16:22.427 --> 01:16:26.331
You see, if I tell somebody about
the beautiful place Canberra is,

1233
01:16:26.331 --> 01:16:28.411
nobody’s going to believe it
till they come and see it.

1234
01:16:28.411 --> 01:16:30.911
So better see it!

1235
01:16:30.911 --> 01:16:32.460
It’s very simple.

1236
01:16:32.480 --> 01:16:36.701
And moreover, see now in this place
there are so many lights, you see

1237
01:16:36.710 --> 01:16:38.501
and to just to switch them on

1238
01:16:38.523 --> 01:16:40.981
there must be one switch: just
switch on, all of them are there,

1239
01:16:40.979 --> 01:16:44.880
all right? But supposing I have to
tell you how all this was built

1240
01:16:44.880 --> 01:16:48.742
and how all this came here, and
how this electricity was invented

1241
01:16:48.756 --> 01:16:52.700
and how the source has been
built, you’ll get a headache.

1242
01:16:52.708 --> 01:16:55.208
So first thing you get your realisation,

1243
01:16:55.208 --> 01:16:58.304
get your light, then in that
light you see for yourself

1244
01:16:58.304 --> 01:17:02.078
and you, you are not a loser,
you don’t get into trouble,

1245
01:17:02.078 --> 01:17:04.578
nothing at all. So first
have it and then know.

1246
01:17:04.578 --> 01:17:06.148
All right?

1247
01:17:06.148 --> 01:17:10.403
You have not to be very
futuristic about it.

1248
01:17:14.958 --> 01:17:17.458
All right?

1249
01:17:23.416 --> 01:17:26.776
So I am happy that your
intellect is now satisfied.

1250
01:17:28.136 --> 01:17:31.326
You have to now help Me by
taking out your shoes,

1251
01:17:31.341 --> 01:17:33.116
because we have to take
help from the Mother Earth.

1252
01:17:33.137 --> 01:17:35.366
She is such an energy-giving thing.

1253
01:17:35.366 --> 01:17:36.836
So we can... No, it’s all right,

1254
01:17:36.838 --> 01:17:39.446
if you are sitting on the ground
you take out your shoes, that’s all.

1255
01:17:39.481 --> 01:17:42.736
If you are sitting on the ground you
are all right, take out just your shoes.

1256
01:17:42.756 --> 01:17:45.256
And also you'll feel comfortable.

1257
01:17:52.466 --> 01:17:54.366
Now Sahaja yogis, as I requested you,

1258
01:17:54.376 --> 01:17:57.796
can you go on the back side
and ask the people to come here?

1259
01:17:57.828 --> 01:18:00.328
[Marathi]

1260
01:18:39.368 --> 01:18:41.868
You can come this side.
Please, come this side.

1261
01:18:41.868 --> 01:18:45.359
There is room. Please come.

1262
01:18:45.379 --> 01:18:47.969
Move forward a little bit,
just a bit move forward. Yes

1263
01:18:47.969 --> 01:18:50.469
you can all move forward a little bit.

1264
01:18:50.469 --> 01:18:54.269
You have to a little bit adjust.
Sorry for this miscalculation.

1265
01:18:57.329 --> 01:19:00.684
Sahaja yogis can go out for the time being.

1266
01:19:11.699 --> 01:19:15.227
I want you all to sit down,
and sit down here closer to Me,

1267
01:19:15.245 --> 01:19:16.975
would be better.
If you sit there

1268
01:19:16.975 --> 01:19:19.675
it won’t help so much as
if you can come this side.

1269
01:19:19.687 --> 01:19:23.964
You have to see Me. Please, if you don’t
mind, come this side and this side.

1270
01:19:23.978 --> 01:19:27.964
Are there any Sahaja yogis?
She’s a Sahaja yogini. No?

1271
01:19:27.984 --> 01:19:31.024
Not yet. All right,
move on, move further.

1272
01:19:33.074 --> 01:19:35.574
I’m sorry for this, really.

1273
01:19:37.011 --> 01:19:39.511
[Marathi]

1274
01:20:12.121 --> 01:20:14.621
Now!

1275
01:20:14.621 --> 01:20:17.121
Only for people who are sitting on the chairs,

1276
01:20:17.121 --> 01:20:19.621
not who are sitting on
the ground are all right.

1277
01:20:19.621 --> 01:20:22.351
Are there some people this
side, can go this side also?

1278
01:20:22.351 --> 01:20:26.491
Can you move so that you can come
this side, please, all of you?

1279
01:20:26.491 --> 01:20:27.411
Can you move this side?

1280
01:20:27.408 --> 01:20:30.321
There is room. Because there’s
some people sitting behind.

1281
01:20:30.346 --> 01:20:33.716
if you don’t mind, if
you could come this side.

1282
01:20:33.716 --> 01:20:37.171
Some of them can come
here. Please come.

1283
01:20:37.206 --> 01:20:40.016
Yes, some of you can move
this side, please. Thank you.

1284
01:20:41.356 --> 01:20:43.856
Can you come here please, all of you?

1285
01:20:46.446 --> 01:20:48.536
Yes, please.

1286
01:20:50.135 --> 01:20:53.366
You, too, madam, come along, this side.

1287
01:20:53.395 --> 01:20:55.895
All of you come along.

1288
01:21:15.915 --> 01:21:18.935
Now, before we start ...

1289
01:21:18.965 --> 01:21:21.465
Won’t you come this side?
There is room here, please.

1290
01:21:22.725 --> 01:21:24.175
Hello

1291
01:21:24.175 --> 01:21:26.675
They are Sahaja yogis? All right.

1292
01:21:32.664 --> 01:21:35.325
The people who are sitting
on the chair should put

1293
01:21:35.325 --> 01:21:41.317
both their legs or feet
apart from each other,

1294
01:21:41.327 --> 01:21:44.677
because these are two powers
on the left and the right.

1295
01:21:44.697 --> 01:21:50.417
The left one is the power of desire,

1296
01:21:50.425 --> 01:21:52.187
of the common desire;

1297
01:21:52.187 --> 01:21:57.105
kundalini is the pure
desire, power of pure desire.

1298
01:21:57.105 --> 01:22:02.517
The right one is the power of action.

1299
01:22:04.257 --> 01:22:07.629
This looks after...  left side
looks after our emotions,

1300
01:22:07.627 --> 01:22:12.499
the right side looks after our
physical and mental activities.

1301
01:22:14.659 --> 01:22:17.679
So you have to put your
left hand on your lap,

1302
01:22:17.694 --> 01:22:21.129
very comfortably on your lap, left hand,

1303
01:22:21.144 --> 01:22:23.953
towards Me. This is symbolic

1304
01:22:23.954 --> 01:22:27.344
that you want to have your Self-realisation.

1305
01:22:29.564 --> 01:22:33.880
Now, there are two
conditions we have to fulfil

1306
01:22:33.900 --> 01:22:36.400
in Sahaja Yoga.

1307
01:22:37.970 --> 01:22:42.420
First one is that you
have to be in the present.

1308
01:22:42.433 --> 01:22:45.584
That means you have to forget the past.

1309
01:22:47.973 --> 01:22:49.614
To be very frank

1310
01:22:49.619 --> 01:22:53.656
you have to know that you
are not guilty of anything.

1311
01:22:55.774 --> 01:22:59.380
Please have no guilty feeling within you.

1312
01:22:59.404 --> 01:23:03.877
This feeling is absolutely hypothetical

1313
01:23:03.888 --> 01:23:06.411
and has no meaning.

1314
01:23:06.411 --> 01:23:10.551
Actually, when you feel guilty
this centre on the left-hand side

1315
01:23:10.557 --> 01:23:15.911
is sometimes so ruined

1316
01:23:15.917 --> 01:23:19.631
that you get horrible diseases like angina,

1317
01:23:19.635 --> 01:23:24.073
lethargic organs, and also spondylitis.

1318
01:23:25.263 --> 01:23:29.799
So what’s the use of having such
a illogical thing like a guilt?

1319
01:23:29.815 --> 01:23:33.799
If you were guilty really,
you would have been in jail.

1320
01:23:33.805 --> 01:23:37.029
So please believe in yourself.
Have faith in yourself

1321
01:23:37.054 --> 01:23:39.554
that you are not guilty at
all. This is very important

1322
01:23:39.574 --> 01:23:42.074
because if this centre is catching,

1323
01:23:42.074 --> 01:23:46.024
which I feel very much is catching today here,

1324
01:23:46.024 --> 01:23:50.827
kundalini won’t rise above. So please,
please, please just forgive yourself

1325
01:23:50.827 --> 01:23:52.627
and know that you are not guilty.

1326
01:23:52.627 --> 01:23:54.447
Many people are told,
you are sinners,

1327
01:23:54.451 --> 01:23:57.147
you are this and that. I tell
you, don’t believe them.

1328
01:23:57.147 --> 01:24:02.002
Because I feel to tell
even this is a sin.

1329
01:24:02.002 --> 01:24:04.502
Nobody has right to
tell someone like that.

1330
01:24:04.502 --> 01:24:09.502
So please have no guilt
about it. Just forget it.

1331
01:24:14.042 --> 01:24:16.542
The animals don’t have
any guilt of anything.

1332
01:24:16.542 --> 01:24:22.344
Only we with our own thinking have
created this institution of guilt.

1333
01:24:25.714 --> 01:24:29.224
Now the second condition is that

1334
01:24:29.234 --> 01:24:32.704
you have to forgive

1335
01:24:32.734 --> 01:24:34.654
everyone,

1336
01:24:34.663 --> 01:24:36.473
in general.

1337
01:24:36.473 --> 01:24:38.323
So see logically again:

1338
01:24:38.323 --> 01:24:40.823
whether you forgive
or don’t forgive,

1339
01:24:40.823 --> 01:24:43.323
you don’t do anything.
What do you do?

1340
01:24:43.323 --> 01:24:47.087
“I cannot forgive. I’ll try to
forgive.” But what is there?

1341
01:24:47.967 --> 01:24:51.737
You don’t do anything; it’s
just a mental process.

1342
01:24:53.419 --> 01:24:57.397
But if you don’t forgive then
you play into wrong hands,

1343
01:24:57.406 --> 01:24:58.482
absolutely.

1344
01:24:58.482 --> 01:25:00.982
And this centre of Christ catches,

1345
01:25:00.982 --> 01:25:02.902
terribly.

1346
01:25:02.902 --> 01:25:05.242
If you don’t forgive,

1347
01:25:05.242 --> 01:25:07.462
this centre

1348
01:25:07.462 --> 01:25:12.511
which is very constricted
and Christ had to be...

1349
01:25:12.525 --> 01:25:15.275
go, had to go through
that and resurrect

1350
01:25:15.275 --> 01:25:18.225
Himself to establish
this centre within you.

1351
01:25:18.244 --> 01:25:22.921
He has given us the greatest
weapon of forgiveness.

1352
01:25:22.945 --> 01:25:25.611
So you have to forgive

1353
01:25:25.611 --> 01:25:27.601
everyone in general.

1354
01:25:27.604 --> 01:25:31.822
Don’t think who is wrong,

1355
01:25:31.835 --> 01:25:34.625
who has done me wrong
nothing of the kind.

1356
01:25:34.635 --> 01:25:39.535
Because when we do not forgive
we play into wrong hands.

1357
01:25:39.555 --> 01:25:41.993
The person who has
troubled us, tortured us,

1358
01:25:42.015 --> 01:25:43.525
is enjoying life.

1359
01:25:43.528 --> 01:25:46.985
But when we do not forgive that person,

1360
01:25:46.998 --> 01:25:53.528
what happens to us, that we play into
wrong hands and we torture ourselves.

1361
01:25:58.945 --> 01:26:03.135
Please remember, that is very
important that you should all forgive.

1362
01:26:03.135 --> 01:26:06.875
Throughout Australia My
programmes have been

1363
01:26:06.890 --> 01:26:10.560
and every time I meet them they say,
“Mother, I never felt any cool breeze.”

1364
01:26:10.560 --> 01:26:12.060
Then I have to go on
working on them:

1365
01:26:12.094 --> 01:26:15.470
“forgive, forgive, forgive,
forgive, forgive” and it works.

1366
01:26:15.472 --> 01:26:20.412
So why not cooperate with Me a little
bit, just to say, “I forgive everyone.”

1367
01:26:20.422 --> 01:26:24.125
Just to say, in general, just forgive.

1368
01:26:24.125 --> 01:26:28.335
If you could just say that,
it will really help Me a lot.

1369
01:26:29.697 --> 01:26:32.787
You’ll also feel much lighter, much lighter.

1370
01:26:32.807 --> 01:26:36.387
You are carrying this load for nothing at
all. So these are the two conditions.

1371
01:26:36.407 --> 01:26:39.747
And the third is a promise:

1372
01:26:39.777 --> 01:26:44.441
that you should have full
confidence in yourself

1373
01:26:44.467 --> 01:26:49.079
and believe that you are going
to get your Self-realisation.

1374
01:26:49.083 --> 01:26:50.851
Most of you will get today.

1375
01:26:50.851 --> 01:26:55.518
Some if they do not get, may...
we try to get them today,

1376
01:26:57.538 --> 01:26:59.811
and then later on they can come.

1377
01:26:59.842 --> 01:27:03.968
But also you must promise
that you should not just

1378
01:27:03.970 --> 01:27:07.782
allow yourself to be drifted away.

1379
01:27:07.793 --> 01:27:09.903
Like Christ has given a parable,

1380
01:27:09.903 --> 01:27:12.793
that some seeds were thrown

1381
01:27:12.813 --> 01:27:15.133
onto lands which were marsh

1382
01:27:15.133 --> 01:27:17.633
of course, the rocks were all wasted.

1383
01:27:17.633 --> 01:27:20.133
But on the marshy lands,

1384
01:27:20.133 --> 01:27:22.633
and they just sprouted and finished.

1385
01:27:22.633 --> 01:27:25.133
So you have to grow into your trees,

1386
01:27:25.133 --> 01:27:31.353
to get to your beings, which is so great.

1387
01:27:31.368 --> 01:27:34.803
That’s a promise from you,
and that will help a lot.

1388
01:27:34.821 --> 01:27:38.706
Because, you see, Divine
also has common sense.

1389
01:27:38.726 --> 01:27:42.916
It doesn’t want to work out
people who are good for nothing.

1390
01:27:43.879 --> 01:27:48.763
It’s not meant for frivolous people.

1391
01:27:48.793 --> 01:27:52.053
You see, if you know that this
light is not going to work out,

1392
01:27:52.041 --> 01:27:54.933
why will you try to correct it?

1393
01:27:57.179 --> 01:27:59.735
So we have to understand our value.

1394
01:27:59.745 --> 01:28:02.245
We have to understand our role,

1395
01:28:02.245 --> 01:28:05.459
how important it is.

1396
01:28:05.485 --> 01:28:07.879
And it’s such an important
time at this time,

1397
01:28:07.879 --> 01:28:09.429
we should not miss it out.

1398
01:28:09.437 --> 01:28:11.779
After all, you have been seeking

1399
01:28:11.809 --> 01:28:15.839
and seeking gives you the right
to get to the Self-realisation

1400
01:28:15.855 --> 01:28:19.335
and then the Divine
has a right to expect

1401
01:28:19.353 --> 01:28:23.855
that you’ll spread the light
all throughout the world.

1402
01:28:23.882 --> 01:28:26.382
You’ll be surprised, when
I went to Russia first,

1403
01:28:26.382 --> 01:28:28.882
twenty-five Germans rushed

1404
01:28:28.882 --> 01:28:31.382
” Sahaja yogis ” to Russia.

1405
01:28:31.382 --> 01:28:34.734
I was really touched. I
said, “How are you all here?

1406
01:28:34.732 --> 01:28:37.094
They said, “Mother, isn’t it our duty?

1407
01:28:37.094 --> 01:28:41.400
Whatever done by our
forefathers we have to undo.”

1408
01:28:41.400 --> 01:28:44.350
And with such gentleness,
with such sweetness.

1409
01:28:44.350 --> 01:28:48.492
you won’t believe these German Sahaja
yogis are one of the gentlest ones.

1410
01:28:49.992 --> 01:28:53.882
They handled these Russians,
gave them so much love,

1411
01:28:55.596 --> 01:28:58.096
so much attention.

1412
01:28:59.916 --> 01:29:04.940
And they have taken the
responsibility of the whole of Russia.

1413
01:29:09.459 --> 01:29:12.819
So we have to be

1414
01:29:12.829 --> 01:29:15.209
conscious of our being

1415
01:29:15.209 --> 01:29:19.919
and then all this knowledge will be
much more manifesting through you.

1416
01:29:19.919 --> 01:29:21.519
If you do not give,

1417
01:29:21.525 --> 01:29:26.049
it won’t come into you. If you
do not open the other door,

1418
01:29:26.059 --> 01:29:28.559
no air will flow from this one.

1419
01:29:29.539 --> 01:29:33.333
So you have to give. And when
you give, you grow deep also;

1420
01:29:33.333 --> 01:29:35.833
like the tree when it grows outward,

1421
01:29:35.833 --> 01:29:37.945
it goes deeper.

1422
01:29:37.959 --> 01:29:42.852
They’re all related. So Sahaja
Yoga is a collective happening.

1423
01:29:42.852 --> 01:29:47.102
It is not individual; you cannot say,
“I do it in the house” and finished.

1424
01:29:47.102 --> 01:29:48.842
No,

1425
01:29:48.852 --> 01:29:50.752
you have to come to the collective.

1426
01:29:50.752 --> 01:29:54.432
It strengthens you, it strengthens others,

1427
01:29:54.432 --> 01:29:56.342
and you understand each and everything.

1428
01:29:56.342 --> 01:30:02.272
And everyone is so much in unison
and in love, you’ll really enjoy it.

1429
01:30:02.296 --> 01:30:07.011
Like a nail which is cut out
of your finger doesn’t grow.

1430
01:30:07.022 --> 01:30:09.422
So now

1431
01:30:09.422 --> 01:30:13.312
it is not an individual thing,

1432
