01:50:32.406 --> 01:50:36.733
if there’s a cool or a hot
breeze of the Holy Ghost

1685
01:50:36.745 --> 01:50:39.245
coming out of your head.

1686
01:50:44.825 --> 01:50:49.257
Now raise your hands, both
of them, towards the sky.

1687
01:50:49.264 --> 01:50:51.477
Raise your hands

1688
01:50:51.477 --> 01:50:53.877
and ask a question,

1689
01:50:53.877 --> 01:50:58.017
“Is this the cool breeze
of the Holy Ghost?”

1690
01:50:58.017 --> 01:51:00.817
or

1691
01:51:00.837 --> 01:51:04.687
“Is this the all-pervading
Power of God’s love?”

1692
01:51:04.693 --> 01:51:07.966
which is called as “ruh” also,

1693
01:51:07.983 --> 01:51:10.876
or “Is this the Paramachaitanya?”

1694
01:51:10.913 --> 01:51:13.413
Ask this question. Push back your head

1695
01:51:13.413 --> 01:51:16.566
fully and ask this question three times,

1696
01:51:16.586 --> 01:51:18.946
any one of them three times.

1697
01:51:18.946 --> 01:51:22.806
Ask any one of these
questions, three times.

1698
01:51:30.967 --> 01:51:38.846
This is the first time you’ll be
feeling this all-pervading Power.

1699
01:51:38.886 --> 01:51:41.777
Now take down your hands, please.

1700
01:51:41.777 --> 01:51:43.726
Put your hands like this.

1701
01:51:43.741 --> 01:51:46.241
Now watch Me without
thinking. You can do it.

1702
01:51:49.741 --> 01:51:52.241
Should I stand?

1703
01:51:53.242 --> 01:51:56.791
Just, you are in thoughtless
awareness, just see;

1704
01:51:56.805 --> 01:51:59.521
even if you cannot see Me you
are in thoughtless awareness,

1705
01:51:59.521 --> 01:52:02.021
absolutely relaxed.

1706
01:52:05.201 --> 01:52:08.481
All those who have felt

1707
01:52:08.491 --> 01:52:13.935
cool breeze or hot breeze out
of their fontanel bone area,

1708
01:52:13.955 --> 01:52:17.960
or they have felt it on their
fingers or on their hands,

1709
01:52:17.970 --> 01:52:20.900
please raise both your hands.

1710
01:52:23.430 --> 01:52:25.930
The capital of Australia!

1711
01:52:25.930 --> 01:52:28.430
May God bless you all.

1712
01:52:30.340 --> 01:52:32.840
So many of you have got it..

1713
01:52:32.840 --> 01:52:36.321
It’s all over! See, but don’t doubt it,

1714
01:52:36.330 --> 01:52:38.830
don’t doubt it. It’s all
over: you can go home

1715
01:52:38.830 --> 01:52:41.990
and close your windows and see,

1716
01:52:42.000 --> 01:52:43.570
it’s all there.

1717
01:52:43.595 --> 01:52:46.095
But you feel extremely
relaxed and happy.

1718
01:52:46.095 --> 01:52:48.595
So now,

1719
01:52:48.595 --> 01:52:52.759
I know it’s time, but still I
would like to meet you people,

1720
01:52:52.775 --> 01:52:54.725
those who have felt the cool breeze.

1721
01:52:54.725 --> 01:52:57.225
Those who have not felt the cool breeze

1722
01:52:57.225 --> 01:52:59.725
could go into another room and

1723
01:52:59.725 --> 01:53:02.845
these people will try to fix it up for you.

1724
01:53:02.865 --> 01:53:05.925
But those who have felt it, I
would like to meet them first,

1725
01:53:05.932 --> 01:53:08.912
and those who then get
their realisation there

1726
01:53:08.925 --> 01:53:10.705
could come and see Me.

1727
01:53:10.705 --> 01:53:13.145
But some people did not do it, so

1728
01:53:13.145 --> 01:53:15.645
that’s not our responsibility in any way.

1729
01:53:15.645 --> 01:53:19.854
In the meanwhile there will
be some very nice music,

1730
01:53:19.875 --> 01:53:23.254
and now you will
enjoy this music better.

1731
01:54:33.142 --> 01:54:37.452
I would like to have some of the
Canberra Sahaja Yogis to come

1732
01:54:37.452 --> 01:54:39.952
and sit and help us in singing

1733
01:54:39.952 --> 01:54:46.482
and also some of... some from Sydney.

1734
01:54:57.824 --> 01:55:01.194
Come on Peter, come on.

1735
01:55:01.589 --> 01:55:04.329
A few from Canberra if they can come.

1736
01:57:40.685 --> 01:57:44.670
Shall I announce?  They will know.

1737
01:57:51.816 --> 01:57:54.316
John,

1738
01:57:54.316 --> 01:57:56.816
this microphone is not working.

1739
01:58:02.279 --> 01:58:04.779
Canberra!

1740
01:58:13.556 --> 01:58:16.718
You must clap while you are sitting.  Please!

1741
01:58:19.977 --> 01:58:22.477
Louder!.

1742
02:05:56.406 --> 02:06:01.000
This song is composed by a
Swiss Sahaja Yogis in Hindi

1743
02:06:01.025 --> 02:06:03.525
and put to tune also I think.

1744
02:06:28.294 --> 02:06:30.794
Hindhi 25.

1745
02:34:54.080 --> 02:34:57.164
I would like the audience to participate more.

1746
02:34:57.210 --> 02:35:01.900
There is a lot of participation, but a
little more will encourage us much more.

1747
02:35:01.924 --> 02:35:04.424
Thank you.

1748
02:41:33.344 --> 02:41:35.844
I'm going to request  [unclear]

1749
02:41:35.872 --> 02:41:43.072
to play [unclear] traditional rural style
as is played in the villages of India,

1750
02:41:43.072 --> 02:41:45.572
before we sing the next song.

